---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Sustainability in Wholesale: GRS-Certified Activewear for Premium Brands"
  description="How Fitclo's sustainable manufacturing practices help high-volume retailers meet ESG goals and attract eco-conscious consumers."
>
  <article class="py-32 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 font-['Century_Gothic',sans-serif]">
    <header class="mb-16">
      <span class="text-accent font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">Sustainability</span>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mt-4 mb-8 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">Sustainability in <span class="text-accent italic">Wholesale Procurement</span></h2>
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-4 text-gray-500 text-sm">
        <span>Published: June 19, 2026</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>8 Min Read</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
      <p class="text-xl text-black font-bold mb-8">In 2026, sustainability is no longer a niche feature—it's a retail requirement. For $20k+ buyers, ESG compliance is essential for long-term brand equity.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">1. The GRS Standard</h2>
      <p>We specialize in <strong>Global Recycled Standard (GRS)</strong> certified fabrics. By utilizing post-consumer recycled polyester and nylon, we reduce carbon emissions by up to 30% compared to virgin materials. For our large-scale partners, we provide full traceability certificates for every batch.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">2. Eco-Friendly Dyeing & Zero-Waste</h2>
      <p>Traditional textile dyeing is water-intensive. We've invested in closed-loop water treatment and low-impact dyes that significantly reduce environmental footprint. Additionally, our <strong>Auto-Cutting technology</strong> reduces fabric waste by 12-15% compared to manual cutting, a saving we pass on to our high-volume clients.</p>

      <div class="my-12 p-10 bg-accent/5 rounded-[40px] border border-accent/20">
        <h4 class="text-xl font-black text-black mb-4 uppercase">Sustainability Checklist for Buyers:</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-accent rounded-full mt-2"></span>
            <span>Verify GRS certification and Transaction Certificates (TC).</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-accent rounded-full mt-2"></span>
            <span>Check for Oeko-Tex Standard 100 compliance for skin safety.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-accent rounded-full mt-2"></span>
            <span>Assess plastic-free or recycled packaging options.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-black uppercase mt-12 mb-6 font-['Montserrat',sans-serif]">3. Long-Term Brand Loyalty</h2>
      <p>Consumer studies show that Gen-Z and Millennial buyers are 60% more likely to repeat-purchase from brands with clear eco-credentials. By sourcing our sustainable stock, you're not just buying a product—you're building a brand that survives the regulatory and consumer shifts of the next decade.</p>
    </div>

    <footer class="mt-20 pt-10 border-t border-gray-100">
      <div class="bg-black text-white p-12 rounded-[40px] text-center">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter mb-6">Build a Sustainable Future</h3>
        <p class="mb-8 text-white/70">Request our Eco-Materials catalog and GRS certifications.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-accent text-black px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:scale-105 transition-transform">View Eco-Catalog</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
